      "text": [
        "3993 - وَ قَالَ رَسُولُ اَللَّهِ صَلَّى اَللَّهُ عَلَيْهِ وَ آلِهِ : \"آكِلُ اَلرِّبَا وَ مُؤْكِلُهُ وَ كَاتِبُهُ وَ شَاهِدَاهُ فِي اَلْوِزْرِ سَوَاءٌ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.3993 - The Messenger of Allah (swt) (may Allah (swt) bless him and his family) said:\n\"The one who consumes usury, the one who gives it, its recorder, and its two witnesses are equal in sin.\""
        ]
      }
